models.description:
✦ LUMENFRAME 2D DynAnimeGive it a whole scene. It can keep track of who does what. LUMENFRAME is built for complex action and faithful prompt following, even when your prompt runs several paragraphs. Choreograph several characters at once, put a prop in a specific hand, specify who passes in front of whom, and set the camera and lighting. LUMENFRAME is at its best when those details matter.

Trigger is not required, but it guides the model toward what it does best --&gt;
"2D Anime style with vibrant colors"⚡ Modern 2D anime in motionExpressive linework, crisp cel shading, and luminous color gi

